          "body": "## Why\n\nThe TUI shell landed on StubSource, so `bf` showed AGENTS (0). Discovery and the board are already on main.\n\n## What\n\n- `src/tui/live.rs`: snapshot from `agents::discover` + `Board::snapshot`\n- `x` sends SIGTERM (refuses pid 1 and this process); `n` posts a board note; claim expire uses board release\n- Bare `bf` uses `LiveSource`\n- `tests/cli_live.rs`: fixture proc + claim appear in the dumb-terminal snapshot\n\n## Review\n\nAuthor vendor: **grok**. Needs a non-grok `REVIEW: approve <head-sha>` then merge `--rebase --delete-branch`.\n\nbf-author: grok/grok-4.6\nbf-claim: grok/pr8-live-source",
