      "tree": {
        "sha": "1c7d16f6a48d87920747ac45a805a4606c064b7b",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neverhuman/bf/git/trees/1c7d16f6a48d87920747ac45a805a4606c064b7b"
      },
      "message": "Wire bare `bf` to live discovery and the board; stop and note from the screen\n\n`bf` with no arguments now shows every live Claude/Codex/Cursor/Grok\nsession and the real board through LiveSource (src/live.rs): agents from\ndiscovery, claims and recent entries from ~/.bf/bf.sqlite, load from\n/proc/loadavg, and the generated AGENT_CHAT.md digest refreshed with a\nLive-agents section every 30 s while the screen runs. `x` on Agents and\n`bf stop <pid>` send TERM then KILL to the target's process group, refuse\npid 1, bf's own ancestry and bf's own group, treat zombies as gone, and\nrecord a stop entry; `bf stop` is human-only (agents get exit 2). `n`\nposts an addressed note; `x` on Board releases a claim as the operator.\n\nPlan of record PR 7 (MVP demo): ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:53Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
